    "Localscan sees only what is listening on local ports: development servers, databases, containers. Memory and CPU are counted for those alone, the rest of the system is not included.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Localscan sees only what is listening on local ports: development servers, databases, containers. Memory and CPU are counted for those alone, the rest of the system is not included."
          }
        },
        "uk": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Localscan бачить лише те, що слухає локальні порти: сервери розробки, бази даних, контейнери. Пам'ять і процесор рахуються тільки по них, решта системи в ці цифри не входить."
          }
        }
      }
    },
